Build fidl_next_protocol without test deps (milestone M8b).

Its test_deps name //third_party/rust_crates:futures, a target upstream's Bazel build does
not define (third_party/rust_crates/BUILD.bazel exports only the Cargo files; the
crates.io aliases are in third_party/rust_crates/vendor), so regen.py cannot map it.
test_deps are dropped, as fuchsia-async's are: //rules:rustc.bzl makes no unit tests
until milestone M16, which revisits this patch. The added lines are the overlay's
(Apache-2.0); the context lines are Fuchsia's (BSD-2-Clause, LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt).
Applied by scripts/regen.py to the rewritten BUILD.bazel.

--- a/src/lib/fidl/rust_next/fidl_next_protocol/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/src/lib/fidl/rust_next/fidl_next_protocol/BUILD.bazel
@@ -49,10 +49,8 @@ rustc_library(
     }),
     crate_name = "fidl_next_protocol",
     edition = "2024",
-    test_deps = [
-        "//vendor/fuchsia/src/lib/fuchsia-async",
-        "//third_party/rust_crates:futures",
-    ],
+    # Overlay: unit tests are milestone M16 (patch 0001).
+    test_deps = [],
     visibility = [
         "//vendor/fuchsia/sdk/lib/driver/component/rust:__subpackages__",
         "//vendor/fuchsia/src/lib/fdomain/client:__subpackages__",
